    "slug": "me-upgrade-ammo-master",
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Years of field experience with specialized ammunition have sharpened your instinct for ammo efficiency. Each ammo power you have active deals <strong>+1 additional damage die</strong> of its type. Incendiary and Disruptor Rounds, which add no dice of their own, add 1d4 fire or 1d4 electricity; Armor-Piercing Rounds add none.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Any two ammo powers. Classes: Soldier.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: the extra die is added to your ranged Strikes while an ammo effect is on you.</em></p>"
    },
